# Daydream exiles Bot1's Ornithopter, which carries Rancor. The creature returns as a new object (CR 400.7), so Rancor
# is no longer attached to anything and is put into the graveyard as a state-based action (CR 704.5m); Rancor's own
# trigger then returns it to its owner's hand. The creature comes back without Rancor's +2/+0 (power 0 + counter 1).

